cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this collection, cite it and the source paper of each skill you use (provenance.source_papers
  in every SKILL.md).
title: ASB Transcriptomics Skill Collection
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: 'Curated, evidence-grounded skill and software-tool collection for computational transcriptomics
  (bulk and single-cell RNA-seq analysis), generated by the AgenticScienceBuilder (ASB) pipeline from
  method papers and their public code repositories. Each skill names its source paper and, where a quote
  could be anchored, cites verbatim evidence from it or its repository README; skills are annotated with
  EDAM (Transcriptomics) and gated for licensing and personal data before release; the source paper of
  every skill is cited in its provenance block (provenance.source_papers) and must be cited alongside
  the collection. Released by the Holobiomics Lab (CNRS / Université Côte d''Azur). Source repositories:
  collection - asb-skills-transcriptomics (repository to follow); registry and tooling - https://github.com/HolobiomicsLab/asb-skill-collections;
  generating pipeline - AgenticScienceBuilder (repository to follow). Licence: collection content CC-BY-4.0;
  code Apache-2.0; verbatim quotes under quotation right (LICENSING.md).'
keywords:
- transcriptomics
- RNA-seq
- single-cell
- differential expression
- scientific agents
- agent skills
- EDAM
- AgenticScienceBuilder
authors:
